sg-session (0.1.0-33) unstable; urgency=medium

  * sg-pdf: a PDF without bookmarks (most of them) showed blank pages --
    poppler has no index for it, PyGObject raised on the NULL iterator, and
    the exception took the viewer's bridge down. The outline is now empty,
    and any unexpected error answers the one request with ERR instead of
    ending the bridge. test/pdf-test.py opens a PDF without an outline.
  * sg-settingsctl bluetooth: a PC without a Bluetooth adapter is answered
    at once (/sys/class/bluetooth has no hci*); bluetoothctl used to wait
    15 s for a bluetoothd that cannot start, freezing Settings' Devices
    page with a garbage-painted window. test/settingsctl-test.py covers it.
  * Both found by the 2026-09-26 ISO QA pass.

